{
  "about": "Which E2E tests a changed file can affect: scripts/e2e.ps1 -Changed reads this. A file gets the union of the tags (and ids) of every rule whose path is a prefix of it; 'ignore' rules are for files no E2E test can see. A file that matches nothing is treated as a risk and runs the smoke set. 'all' means a contract changed: run the full gate. RunnerSelfTests checks that every tag exists and that every plugin folder has a rule, so a new plugin has to say what covers it.",
